# The build inlines src-shared/ byte-for-byte into javascript/, and CI checks
# that the committed output matches a fresh build. Keep the line endings in the
# repository identical on every platform or that check fails on Windows clones.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are captured bytes from real sites; do not touch them.
scripts/test-harness/fixtures/** -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
